    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000rfgy](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000rfgy) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Dec 04 2025 86km SE of Kara-Say. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 41.0259 longitude 78.4505. It impacted 12131 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
